[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:34. Quick Work]
[00:00.440]Passage 34 | 文章三十四
[00:02.535]Quick Work. | 快速行动。
[00:04.570]Ted Robinson has been worried all the week. | 泰德·罗宾逊整个星期都忧心忡忡。
[00:09.110]Last Tuesday, he received a letter from the local police. | 上周二，他收到当地警方的来信。
[00:13.815]In the letter, he was asked to call at the station. | 信中要求他去警察局报到。
[00:18.365]Ted wondered why he was wanted by the police. | 泰德想知道为什么警察要找他。
[00:22.220]But he went to the station yesterday and now he is not worried any more. | 但他昨天去了警察局，现在他不再担心了。
[00:27.635]At the station, he was told by a smiling policeman that his bicycle had been found. | 在警察局，一位面带微笑的警察告诉他，他的自行车找到了。
[00:34.675]Five days ago, the policeman told him, the bicycle was picked up in a small village 400 miles away. | 警察告诉他，五天前，那辆自行车在400英里外的一个小村庄被找到了。
[00:43.140]It is now being sent to his home by train. | 现在正通过火车运往他家。
[00:47.675]Ted was most surprised when he heard the news. | 泰德听到这个消息时非常惊讶。
[00:52.265]He was amused too. | 他也觉得很好笑。
[00:54.315]Because he never expected the bicycle to be found. | 因为他从未想过自行车能被找回。
[00:57.795]It was stolen 20 years ago when Ted was a boy of 15. | 那是20年前，泰德15岁时被偷的。